        <mxCell id="steps" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px;color:#0E4938&quot;&gt;The story in four steps&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.5px;color:#2C3E50;line-height:1.9&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;1.&lt;/b&gt;&#160; NOKAS counts the bags and records the result.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;2.&lt;/b&gt;&#160; Every 30 minutes those results are copied to the platform&lt;br/&gt;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160; and filed under the customer they belong to.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;3.&lt;/b&gt;&#160; A customer asks the API for their counting results.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;4.&lt;/b&gt;&#160; The API recognises them and returns only their own data.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D5DBDB;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=12;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="500" width="510" height="180" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="colourKey" value="Colours show whose data is whose &#8212; a customer&#39;s colour never crosses into another&#39;s." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#95A5A6;fontStyle=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
